en the materials used in this study or similar before?<\/div><div>If yes - please indicate where.<br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"fun-seen","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Have you ever seen the materials used in this study or similar before? If yes - please indicate w...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes (if yes, please write in the box below where)","TextEntry":"true","InputHeight":24,"InputWidth":680},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["2","1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1330"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1284","SecondaryAttribute":"Help us improve for the next studies - Did you spot any errors? Anything missing or wrong? Someth...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Help us improve for the next studies - Did you spot any errors? Anything missing or wrong? Something we should pay attention to in next runs? (briefly)","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"funnel-improve","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":680,"InputHeight":29},"QuestionDescription":"Help us improve for the next studies - Did you spot any errors? Anything missing or wrong? Someth...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1284","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1332","SecondaryAttribute":"Help us improve for the next studies - Did you spot any errors? Anything missing or wrong? Someth...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText