rio, make a managerial decision, and briefly explain it in one sentence?<\/div><\/div>","DataExportTag":"quiz","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"This survey involves having to make a managerial decision based on a situation described in a sce...","Choices":{"28":{"Display":"Yes"},"29":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["28","29"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1290","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1289","SecondaryAttribute":"This survey involves reading a scenario with a short 4-5 questions quiz asking very simple compre...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>This survey involves reading a scenario with a short 4-5 questions quiz asking very simple comprehension questions verifying that you read and understood the scenario .<\/div><div><br><\/div>Would you be able to carefully read the scenario and answer 4-5 comprehension quiz questions?","DataExportTag":"scenario","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"This survey involves reading a scenario with a short 4-5 questions quiz asking very simple compre...","Choices":{"30":{"Display":"Yes"},"31":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["30","31"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1289","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1271","SecondaryAttribute":"This survey is a writing task, and it requires you to think and write 10 Facebook status updates...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"This survey is a writing task, and it requires you to think and write 10 Facebook status updates as if you are writing those on your own Facebook account.&nbsp;<div><br><\/div><div>Are you able to dedicate the time needed to write 10 authentic looking status updates within the given time-frame and offered compensation?<\/div>","DataExportTag":"dedicated","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"This survey is a writing task, and it requires you to think and write 10 Facebook status updates...","Choices":{"28":{"Display":"Yes"},"29":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["28","29"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1271","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1270","SecondaryAttribute":"This survey is only intended for native English speakers born and raised in the United States. Ar...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>This survey is only intended for native English speakers born and raised in the United States.<\/div><div><br><\/div>Are you a native English speaker born and raised in the US?","DataExportTag":"native","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"This survey is only intended for native English speakers born and raised in the United States. Ar...","Choices":{"30":{"Display":"Yes"},"31":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["30","31"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1270","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1272","SecondaryAttribute":"This survey is only intended for people who are active on Facebook in their everyday lives. Are y...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>This survey is only intended for people who are active on Facebook in their everyday lives.<\/div><div><br><\/div>Are you an active user on Facebook?","DataExportTag":"facebook","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"This survey is only intended for people who are active on Facebook in their everyday lives. Are y...","Choices":{"30":{"Display":"Yes"},"31":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":["30","31"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1272","Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID607","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"funnel-time","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionText_Safe":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID607","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":16,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1327","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"fun-time","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":"0","MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":20,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1327"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1227","SecondaryAttribute":"We would like to thank you for taking part and hope you found it interesting. The experiments in...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>We would like to thank you for taking part and hope you found it interesting.<br>\n<br>\nThe experiments in which you participated today were designed to examine how personal and environmental factors may affect human cognition and decision making. In psychology, it has been known that information can affect person\u2019s behavior to certain extent and that individual differences affect behavior. The purpose of the study was to know how exposure to stimuli and certain individual differences affect decision making and behavior.<br>\n<br>\nIt's important to note that all of the information that was collected today will be kept in complete confidentiality and there will no attempt or interest in connecting your provided personal information with your responses. This data will be used for research purposes alone and not shared or reported to anyone. We are not interested in any one participant\u2019s responses by themselves. Rather, we are interested in the general responses of all participants when they are combined together.<br>\n<br>\nWe ask that you please do not share the details of this study with anyone because they may be potential participants and knowing the purpose of the study beforehand may affect the results. Thank you very much for your participation.<br>\nIf you would like information about the results, or have further questions for us, please contact Gilad Feldman <a href=\"mailto:gfeldman@hku.hk\">gfeldman@hku.hk<\/a>&nbsp;at any time. You can also <a href=\"http:\/\/mgto.org\" target=\"_blank\">read more about Gilad's research in his website<\/a>.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Please press NEXT (&gt;&gt;), and wait for confirmation and <u>your secret completion key<\/u><\/strong><\/p>","DataExportTag":"debrief","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We would like to thank you for taking part and hope you found it interesting. The experiments in...","ChoiceOrder":[],"GradingData":[],"Language":{"ZH-T":{"QuestionText":"<p>\u975e\u5e38\u611f\u8b1d\u4f60\u53c3\u8207\u6211\u5011\u7684\u7814\u7a76\uff0c\u4e26\u5e0c\u671b\u4f60\u89ba\u5f97\u9019\u500b\u7814\u7a76\u5f88\u6709\u8da3\u3002\u8acb\u5c0d\u672c\u7814\u7a76\u7684\u7d30\u7bc0\u548c\u4f60\u7684\u7b54\u6848\u4fdd\u5bc6\uff0c\u5728\u7814\u7a76\u5b8c\u6210\u5f8c\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u8981\u900f\u9732\u7d66\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u77e5\u9053\u3002<\/p><p><br>\n\u9019\u9805\u7814\u7a76\u7684\u76ee\u7684\u662f\u8a55\u4f30\u4eba\u5011\u5c0d\u81ea\u5df1\u8207\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u4e92\u52d5\u7684\u770b\u6cd5\u3002<\/p><p><br>\n\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u60f3\u9032\u4e00\u6b65\u4e86\u89e3\u672c\u7814\u7a76\u53ca\u7d50\u679c\uff0c\u8acb\u900f\u904e\u4ee5\u4e0b\u96fb\u5b50\u90f5\u4ef6\u5730\u5740\u8207\u6211\u5011\u806f\u7d61\uff0c\u6211\u5011\u5c07\u5f88\u6a02\u610f\u8207\u4f60\u5206\u4eab\u66f4\u591a\uff1a<\/p>\n\n<p>Gilad FELDMAN - filian@ust.hk<\/p><p><br>\n\u8981\u63d0\u4ea4\u4f60\u7684\u7b54\u6848\uff0c\u8acb\u6309NEXT (&gt;&gt;)\uff0c\u7b49\u5f85\u78ba\u8a8d\uff0c\u4e26\u5b89\u975c\u5730\u8209\u624b\u3002<\/p>"}},"QuestionID":"QID1227","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1326","SecondaryAttribute":"We would like to thank you for taking part and hope you found it interesting. The experiments in...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>We would like to thank you for taking part and hope you found it interesting.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThe experiments in which you participated today were designed to examine how personal and environmental factors may affect human cognition and decision making. In psychology, it has been known that information can affect person&rsquo;s behavior to certain extent and that individual differences affect behavior. The purpose of the study was to know how exposure to stimuli and certain individual differences affect decision making and behavior.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIt&#39;s important to note that all of the information that was collected today will be kept in complete confidentiality and there will no attempt or interest in connecting your provided personal information with your responses. This data will be used for research purposes alone and not shared or reported to anyone. We are not interested in any one participant&rsquo;s responses by themselves. Rather, we are interested in the general responses of all participants when they are combined together.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWe ask that you please do not share the details of this study with anyone because they may be potential participants and knowing the purpose of the study beforehand may affect the results. Thank you very much for your participation.<br \/>\nIf you would like information about the results, or have further questions for us, please contact Gilad Feldman <a href=\"mailto:gfeldman@hku.hk\">gfeldman@hku.hk<\/a>&nbsp;at any time. You can also <a href=\"http:\/\/mgto.org\" target=\"_blank\">read more about Gilad&#39;s research in his website<\/a>.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Please press NEXT (&gt;&gt;), and wait for confirmation...<\/strong><\/p>","DataExportTag":"debrief","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We would like to thank you for taking part and hope you found it interesting. The experiments in...","ChoiceOrder":[],"GradingData":[],"Language":{"ZH-T":{"QuestionText":"<p>\u975e\u5e38\u611f\u8b1d\u4f60\u53c3\u8207\u6211\u5011\u7684\u7814\u7a76\uff0c\u4e26\u5e0c\u671b\u4f60\u89ba\u5f97\u9019\u500b\u7814\u7a76\u5f88\u6709\u8da3\u3002\u8acb\u5c0d\u672c\u7814\u7a76\u7684\u7d30\u7bc0\u548c\u4f60\u7684\u7b54\u6848\u4fdd\u5bc6\uff0c\u5728\u7814\u7a76\u5b8c\u6210\u5f8c\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u8981\u900f\u9732\u7d66\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u77e5\u9053\u3002<\/p><p><br>\n\u9019\u9805\u7814\u7a76\u7684\u76ee\u7684\u662f\u8a55\u4f30\u4eba\u5011\u5c0d\u81ea\u5df1\u8207\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u4e92\u52d5\u7684\u770b\u6cd5\u3002<\/p><p><br>\n\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u60f3\u9032\u4e00\u6b65\u4e86\u89e3\u672c\u7814\u7a76\u53ca\u7d50\u679c\uff0c\u8acb\u900f\u904e\u4ee5\u4e0b\u96fb\u5b50\u90f5\u4ef6\u5730\u5740\u8207\u6211\u5011\u806f\u7d61\uff0c\u6211\u5011\u5c07\u5f88\u6a02\u610f\u8207\u4f60\u5206\u4eab\u66f4\u591a\uff1a<\/p>\n\n<p>Gilad FELDMAN - filian@ust.hk<\/p><p><br>\n\u8981\u63d0\u4ea4\u4f60\u7684\u7b54\u6848\uff0c\u8acb\u6309NEXT (&gt;&gt;)\uff0c\u7b49\u5f85\u78ba\u8a8d\uff0c\u4e26\u5b89\u975c\u5730\u8209\u624b\u3002<\/p>"}},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1326"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_4Jy9WYiP9voHBpH","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID609","SecondaryAttribute":"What do you think the purpose of the study was? (one sentence)","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What do you think the purpose of the study was? (one sentence)","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"funnel-purpose","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":680,"InputHeight":29},"QuestionDescription":"What do you think the purpose of the study was? (one sentence)","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Questio